<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Form 02</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:10mm 12mm 16mm;@bottom-center{content:"Bloomwell Home Care Uganda Limited · Nest Mama Program · Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);font:7pt Arial,sans-serif;color:#47615E}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#0B2E2A;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:1.35}
.hd{background:#08675F;color:#fff;padding:3mm 5mm;border-bottom:1.4mm solid #F8991E}.hd table{width:100%}.hd td{vertical-align:middle}.hd .n{font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold}.hd .s{font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}.hd .r{text-align:right;font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}
.tt{border:.3mm solid #08675F;background:#DDF0EC;padding:2.5mm 3mm;margin:3mm 0}.tt b{font-size:12pt;color:#08675F}.tt div{font-size:7.5pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:1mm}
h3{font-size:9pt;color:#08675F;margin:4mm 0 1.5mm;border-bottom:.3mm solid #F8991E;padding-bottom:.8mm;break-after:avoid}
table.r{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2mm 0;margin:0 -2mm}table.r{table-layout:fixed}
.c{vertical-align:bottom;padding-top:1.5mm}.l{display:block;font-size:6.8pt;color:#47615E}.v{display:block;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:5.5mm;font-size:8.5pt;font-weight:bold}
.w{margin-top:1.5mm;break-inside:avoid}.w .v{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:11mm;padding:1mm 1.5mm;font-weight:normal;background:#FBFDFC}
.cb{margin-top:1.8mm;break-inside:avoid}.cb .o{display:inline-block;margin:0 4mm 0 0;font-size:8.5pt}.cb .l{display:inline;margin-right:3mm;font-size:8pt;color:#0B2E2A;font-weight:bold}
.n{border:.3mm solid #E0B25A;background:#FFF6E3;padding:2mm 3mm;margin-top:2.5mm;font-size:7.8pt;break-inside:avoid}
p.t{margin:2mm 0;font-size:8.3pt;break-inside:avoid}
table.g{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:2mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.g th{background:#08675F;color:#fff;font-size:6.8pt;padding:1.4mm;text-align:left}.g td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;height:7.5mm;padding:.5mm 1.5mm;font-size:8pt}.g tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#F2F8F6}
table.s{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:3mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.s th{background:#E8F2F0;font-size:6.8pt;text-align:left;padding:1.2mm;border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5}.s td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;padding:1.2mm;vertical-align:top;height:15mm;font-size:7.8pt}
.s .m{font-size:6.8pt;line-height:1.5}.si{max-height:10mm;display:block}.ev{font-size:6pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:.8mm}
.idr{margin-top:1mm}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid}</style></head><body><div class="hd"><table><tr><td style="width:14mm">{{ org.mark_svg|safe }}</td><td><div class="n">BLOOMWELL HOME CARE UGANDA LIMITED</div><div class="s">Patient consent and care forms · Nest Mama Program · You rest, we care</div></td><td class="r">{{ org.city }}, Uganda<br>{{ org.phone }}</td></tr></table></div><div class="tt"><b>FORM 02. INITIAL NURSING ASSESSMENT</b><div>Record baseline findings, care needs and whether home care is suitable. Completed by a registered nurse within professional competence before care commences. This form does not prescribe treatment.</div></div><table class="r idr"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient full name</span><span class="v">{{ patient.name }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">DOB / age</span><span class="v">{{ patient.dob }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient record ID</span><span class="v">{{ patient.record_id }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Date / time</span><span class="v">{{ form.datetime }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Consent to this assessment obtained (Form 03 reference)</span><span class="v">{{ v.consent_to_this_assessment_obtained_form or prefill.consent_to_this_assessment_obtained_form }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Presenting concerns and patient priorities</span><span class="v">{{ v.presenting_concerns_and_patient_prioriti or prefill.presenting_concerns_and_patient_prioriti }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Relevant diagnoses / history, recent surgery / admission and discharge instructions</span><span class="v">{{ v.relevant_diagnoses_history_recent_surger or prefill.relevant_diagnoses_history_recent_surger }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Medicines including non-prescription / herbal products, and source checked</span><span class="v">{{ v.medicines_including_non_prescription_her or prefill.medicines_including_non_prescription_her }}</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Allergies and reactions</span><span class="v">{{ v.allergies_and_reactions or prefill.allergies_and_reactions }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Verified with</span><span class="v">{{ v.verified_with or prefill.verified_with }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Baseline observations (where clinically indicated)</h3><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Time</span><span class="v">{{ v.time or prefill.time }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Temperature C</span><span class="v">{{ v.temperature_c or prefill.temperature_c }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Pulse /min</span><span class="v">{{ v.pulse_min or prefill.pulse_min }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Respirations /min</span><span class="v">{{ v.respirations_min or prefill.respirations_min }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">BP mmHg</span><span class="v">{{ v.bp_mmhg or prefill.bp_mmhg }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">SpO2 %</span><span class="v">{{ v.spo2 or prefill.spo2 }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Room air / oxygen device and flow</span><span class="v">{{ v.room_air_oxygen_device_and_flow or prefill.room_air_oxygen_device_and_flow }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Pain score / tool</span><span class="v">{{ v.pain_score_tool or prefill.pain_score_tool }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Glucose mmol/L if indicated</span><span class="v">{{ v.glucose_mmol_l_if_indicated or prefill.glucose_mmol_l_if_indicated }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Weight kg</span><span class="v">{{ v.weight_kg or prefill.weight_kg }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Consciousness, breathing / circulation, symptoms and action on abnormal findings</span><span class="v">{{ v.consciousness_breathing_circulation_symp or prefill.consciousness_breathing_circulation_symp }}</span></div><h3>Function and care needs</h3><div class="w"><span class="l">Mobility / falls; skin / pressure risk; nutrition / swallowing; hydration and elimination</span><span class="v">{{ v.mobility_falls_skin_pressure_risk_nutrit or prefill.mobility_falls_skin_pressure_risk_nutrit }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Cognition / communication; emotional needs; safeguarding; cultural preferences</span><span class="v">{{ v.cognition_communication_emotional_needs_ or prefill.cognition_communication_emotional_needs_ }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Devices, wounds, infection precautions and specialist assessments needed</span><span class="v">{{ v.devices_wounds_infection_precautions_and or prefill.devices_wounds_infection_precautions_and }}</span></div>{% if patient.type in ["Mama","Baby"] %}<div class="n">Maternal / newborn care: record relevant delivery / gestation, feeding, maternal or baby concerns and attach the appropriate clinical assessment. Mother and baby remain separate patients.</div>{% endif %}<h3>Home safety and suitability</h3><div class="w"><span class="l">Caregiver capacity; safe access; water / hygiene; equipment; sharps / waste arrangements</span><span class="v">{{ v.caregiver_capacity_safe_access_water_hyg or prefill.caregiver_capacity_safe_access_water_hyg }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Risks identified, safeguards and responsible person</span><span class="v">{{ v.risks_identified_safeguards_and_responsi or prefill.risks_identified_safeguards_and_responsi }}</span></div><div class="cb"><span class="l">Home care suitable:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.home_care_suitable == "Yes" else "☐" }} Yes</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.home_care_suitable == "Yes with conditions" else "☐" }} Yes with conditions</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.home_care_suitable == "Referral required" else "☐" }} Referral required</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Conditions / referral, responsible clinician and review time</span><span class="v">{{ v.conditions_referral_responsible_clinicia or prefill.conditions_referral_responsible_clinicia }}</span></div><h3>Signatures</h3><table class="s"><tr><th style="width:27mm">Role</th><th style="width:44mm">Name and details</th><th style="width:30mm">Method</th><th>Signature or thumbprint, with e-signature evidence</th><th style="width:24mm">Date / time</th></tr><tr><td><b>Clinician</b></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.name or author.name }}<div class="m">Name and UNMC number</div><div>{{ sig.nurse.detail or author.registration_line }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "password" else "☐" }} Account password<br></td><td>{% if sig.nurse.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.nurse.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.nurse.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.at }}</td></tr></table></body></html>